#: ExamTypesSection.kt
msgid ""
"Answer multiple-choice questions within a strict time limit. Each question "
"delivers instant feedback and a detailed explanation, so you reinforce the "
"concept immediately. Ideal for testing theoretical knowledge, language "
"syntax, and SDK fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Answer multiple-choice questions within a strict time limit. Each question "
"delivers instant feedback and a detailed explanation, so you reinforce the "
"concept immediately. Ideal for testing theoretical knowledge, language "
"syntax, and SDK fundamentals."

#: ExamTypesSection.kt
msgid ""
"Write algorithms that read from standard input and print the correct output. "
"Solutions are validated against hidden test cases covering normal inputs, "
"boundary conditions, and adversarial edge cases — exactly the format used in "
"competitive programming contests."
msgstr ""
"Write algorithms that read from standard input and print the correct output. "
"Solutions are validated against hidden test cases covering normal inputs, "
"boundary conditions, and adversarial edge cases — exactly the format used in "
"competitive programming contests."

#: ExamTypesSection.kt
msgid ""
"Implement functions that are injected directly into a hidden test harness. "
"Your code must satisfy a full automated test suite written by the exam "
"creator — the same paradigm used in professional TDD workflows and "
"code-review pipelines."
msgstr ""
"Implement functions that are injected directly into a hidden test harness. "
"Your code must satisfy a full automated test suite written by the exam "
"creator — the same paradigm used in professional TDD workflows and "
"code-review pipelines."

